config
.
. Phase 6b lz_runtime config — the nested init that hosts Sculpt's
. Leitzentrale subsystem headlessly (Sponge OS).
.
. Children:
.   lz_relay      - report_rom; relays leitzentrale subsystem state to
.                   lz_probe as "lz_subsys_state".
.   leitzentrale  - the subsystem (sculpt_manager + GUI stack + the
.                   runtime_view that paints the dialogs); its config
.                   comes from the seeded model fs (child/leitzentrale,
.                   i.e. repos/sponge/src/leitzentrale/subsys.config).
.   lz_probe      - alive-check (Phase 6a).
.
. runtime_view lives INSIDE the subsystem (Phase 6b) so it can read the
. dialog ROMs directly; it renders on the subsystem's inner nitpicker,
. which composites onto gui_fb, which gui_fader fades and the manager
. proxies to the outer nitpicker. lz_runtime only forwards Gui + the
. focus/hover/leitzentrale_enabled ROMs into the subsystem.
.
+ parent-provides
  + service ROM
  + service PD
  + service RM
  + service CPU
  + service LOG
  + service Timer
  + service Report
  + service Gui
  + service File_system

+ default-route
  + any-service
    + parent
    + any-child

+ default | caps: 200 | ram: 4M

+ start lz_relay | ram: 4M
  + binary report_rom
  + provides
    + service Report
    + service ROM
  + config | verbose: no
    + policy | label: lz_probe -> lz_subsys_state | report: leitzentrale -> state

+ start leitzentrale | caps: 4600 | ram: 768M
  + binary init
  + route
    + service ROM | label: config | + parent | label: leitzentrale.config
    + service ROM | label_suffix: lz_config | + parent
    + service Report | label_suffix: lz_model | + parent
    + service Report | label_suffix: lz_watch_result | + parent
    + service Report | label: state | + child lz_relay
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start lz_probe | caps: 100 | ram: 8M
  + route
    + service ROM | label: lz_subsys_state | + child lz_relay
    + service Timer                        | + parent
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child
-
